 يعبّر عن أجزاء من مئة؛ يمكن توسيع الكسر دون تغيير قيمته.","En":"Decimal place-value rule: a denominator of 100 represents hundredths. Scale both parts of the fraction equally."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"للوصول إلى مقام 100 نضرب 20 في 5.","En":"To obtain denominator 100, multiply 20 by 5."},{"Ar":"نضرب البسط أيضاً في 5: $\\frac7{20}=\\frac{35}{100}$.","En":"Multiply the numerator by 5 as well: $\\frac7{20}=\\frac{35}{100}$."},{"Ar":"خمسة وثلاثون جزءاً من مئة تكتب $0.35$.","En":"Thirty-five hundredths is written as $0.35$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0.35$","En":"$0.35$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتب 35 جزءاً من ألف بدلاً من 35 جزءاً من مئة.","En":"Do not write 35 thousandths instead of 35 hundredths."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac ab=\\frac{ka}{kb},\\quad b,k\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$7\\times5=35$، أي $35/100$.","En":"$7\\times5=35$, giving $35/100$."},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0.35\\times20=7$","En":"$0.35\\times20=7$"}},"TrackIds":[5],"CategoryId":21,"PrimarySkillId":94,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حاول تحويل المقام إلى مئة.","En":"Try changing the denominator to one hundred."},{"Ar":"وسّع الكسر بالمعامل نفسه ثم اقرأ البسط بوصفه أجزاء من مئة.","En":"Scale both parts equally, then read the numerator as hundredths."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قاعدة التمثيل العشري: الكسر ذو المقام 100 يعبّر عن أجزاء من مئة؛ يمكن توسيع الكسر دون تغيير قيمته.","En":"Decimal place-value rule: a denominator of 100 represents hundredths. Scale both parts of the fraction equally."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"للوصول إلى مقام 100 نضرب 20 في 5.","En":"To obtain denominator 100, multiply 20 by 5."},{"Ar":"نضرب البسط أيضاً في 5: $\\frac7{20}=\\frac{35}{100}$.","En":"Multiply the numerator by 5 as well: $\\frac7{20}=\\frac{35}{100}$."},{"Ar":"خمسة وثلاثون جزءاً من مئة تكتب $0.35$.","En":"Thirty-five hundredths is written as $0.35$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0.35$","En":"$0.35$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تكتب 35 جزءاً من ألف بدلاً من 35 جزءاً من مئة.","En":"Do not write 35 thousandths instead of 35 hundredths."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac ab=\\frac{ka}{kb},\\quad b,k\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$7\\times5=35$، أي $35/100$.","En":"$7\\times5=35$, giving $35/100$."},"Verification":{"Ar":"$0.35\\times20=7$","En":"$0.35\\times20=7$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"place-value","Reason":{"Ar":"0.7 مضروباً في 20 يساوي 14 لا 7.","En":"0.7 times 20 equals 14, not 7."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"conversion-error","Reason":{"Ar":"0.14 مضروباً في 20 يساوي 2.8.","En":"0.14 times 20 equals 2.8."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"place-value","Reason":{"Ar":"0.035 يساوي 35 جزءاً من ألف، لا من مئة.","En":"0.035 is 35 thousandths, not hundredths."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قاعدة التمثيل العشري: الكسر ذو المقام 100 يعبّر عن أجزاء من مئة؛ يمكن توسيع الكسر دون تغيير قيمته.

$\frac ab=\frac{ka}{kb},\quad b,k\ne0$

1. للوصول إلى مقام 100 نضرب 20 في 5.

2. نضرب البسط أيضاً في 5: $\frac7{20}=\frac{35}{100}$.

3. خمسة وثلاثون جزءاً من مئة تكتب $0.35$.

$7\times5=35$، أي $35/100$.

$0.35$ بلا وحدة قياس

$0.35\times20=7$

لا تكتب 35 جزءاً من ألف بدلاً من 35 جزءاً من مئة.$mw$,$mw$Decimal place-value rule: a denominator of 100 represents hundredths. Scale both parts of the fraction equally.

$\frac ab=\frac{ka}{kb},\quad b,k\ne0$

1. To obtain denominator 100, multiply 20 by 5.

2. Multiply the numerator by 5 as well: $\frac7{20}=\frac{35}{100}$.

3. Thirty-five hundredths is written as $0.35$.

$7\times5=35$, giving $35/100$.

$0.35$ Dimensionless

$0.35\times20=7$

Do not write 35 thousandths instead of 35 hundredths.$mw$),
(605,430,$mw$F1C5621F372D17B647688C6B3316BFA9B032A672EB9A3EBB5FCC9BDFEE597963$mw$,$mw$b5e558fa2d117b9e088ba21bdcb0c946$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":430,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":22,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب المدى الربيعي وبيان اصطلاح تعريف الربيعات","TitleEn":"Compute the interquartile range with a stated quartile convention","QuestionTextAr":"للبيانات المرتبة 2، 4، 6، 8، 10، 12، 14، احسب المدى الربيعي باستخدام وسيطي النصفين بعد استبعاد الوسيط العام.","QuestionTextEn":"For the sorted data 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, find the IQR using medians of the two halves excluding the overall median.","DetailedSolutionAr":"الوسيط العام 8. في النصف الأدنى $Q_1=4$ وفي الأعلى $Q_3=12$، لذا $IQR=Q_3-Q_1=8$.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Exclude the overall median 8. The lower-half median is $Q_1=4$ and upper-half median is $Q_3=12$. Thus $IQR=8$.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":1709,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1710,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":1711,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":1712,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استبعد الوسيط العام عند تقسيم القائمة كما يطلب السؤال.","En":"Exclude the overall median when splitting the list as instructed."},{"Ar":"أوجد وسيط كل نصف ثم اطرح الربيع الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"Find the median of each half, then subtract the lower quartile from the upper."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب المدى الربيعي وبيان اصطلاح تعريف الربيعات","En":"Compute the interquartile range with a stated quartile convention"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $14-2=12$ هي المدى الكلي، وليست فرق الربيعين.","En":"The value $14-2=12$ is the full range, not the quartile difference."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"12"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة 6 تنتج عند إدراج الوسيط العام في النصفين، خلافاً للطريقة المحددة.","En":"The value 6 results from including the overall median in both halves, contrary to the specified method."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"فرق الربيعين هو $12-4$ وليس $12-2$؛ العدد 2 هو الحد الأدنى لا الربيع الأول.","En":"The quartile difference is $12-4$, not $12-2$; 2 is the minimum, not the first quartile."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"للبيانات المرتبة 2، 4، 6، 8، 10، 12، 14، احسب المدى الربيعي باستخدام وسيطي النصفين بعد استبعاد الوسيط العام.","En":"For the sorted data 2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14, find the IQR using medians of the two halves excluding the overall median."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المدى الربيعي فرق الربيعين الثالث والأول.","En":"The interquartile range is the third quartile minus the first."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الوسيط العام هو 8؛ نستبعده وفق قاعدة السؤال.","En":"The overall median is 8; exclude it as the question specifies."},{"Ar":"النصف الأدنى $(2,4,6)$ وسيطه $Q_1=4$، والنصف الأعلى $(10,12,14)$ وسيطه $Q_3=12$.","En":"The lower half $(2,4,6)$ has median $Q_1=4$; the upper half $(10,12,14)$ has median $Q_3=12$."},{"Ar":"نطرح: $IQR=12-4=8$.","En":"Subtract: $IQR=12-4=8$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المدى الكلي بالمدى الربيعي.","En":"Do not confuse the full range with the IQR."},"FormulaLatex":"IQR=Q_3-Q_1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$Q_1=4,\\quad Q_3=12,\\quad IQR=12-4=8$","En":"$Q_1=4,\\quad Q_3=12,\\quad IQR=12-4=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4+8=12$","En":"$4+8=12$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":22,"PrimarySkillId":98,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استبعد الوسيط العام عند تقسيم القائمة كما يطلب السؤال.","En":"Exclude the overall median when splitting the list as instructed."},{"Ar":"أوجد وسيط كل نصف ثم اطرح الربيع الأدنى من الأعلى.","En":"Find the median of each half, then subtract the lower quartile from the upper."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"المدى الربيعي فرق الربيعين الثالث والأول.","En":"The interquartile range is the third quartile minus the first."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"الوسيط العام هو 8؛ نستبعده وفق قاعدة السؤال.","En":"The overall median is 8; exclude it as the question specifies."},{"Ar":"النصف الأدنى $(2,4,6)$ وسيطه $Q_1=4$، والنصف الأعلى $(10,12,14)$ وسيطه $Q_3=12$.","En":"The lower half $(2,4,6)$ has median $Q_1=4$; the upper half $(10,12,14)$ has median $Q_3=12$."},{"Ar":"نطرح: $IQR=12-4=8$.","En":"Subtract: $IQR=12-4=8$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تخلط المدى الكلي بالمدى الربيعي.","En":"Do not confuse the full range with the IQR."},"FormulaLatex":"IQR=Q_3-Q_1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$Q_1=4,\\quad Q_3=12,\\quad IQR=12-4=8$","En":"$Q_1=4,\\quad Q_3=12,\\quad IQR=12-4=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4+8=12$","En":"$4+8=12$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة $14-2=12$ هي المدى الكلي، وليست فرق الربيعين.","En":"The value $14-2=12$ is the full range, not the quartile difference."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"القيمة 6 تنتج عند إدراج الوسيط العام في النصفين، خلافاً للطريقة المحددة.","En":"The value 6 results from including the overall median in both halves, contrary to the specified method."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"فرق الربيعين هو $12-4$ وليس $12-2$؛ العدد 2 هو الحد الأدنى لا الربيع الأول.","En":"The quartile difference is $12-4$, not $12-2$; 2 is the minimum, not the first quartile."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$المدى الربيعي فرق الربيعين الثالث والأول.

$IQR=Q_3-Q_1$

1. الوسيط العام هو 8؛ نستبعده وفق قاعدة السؤال.

2. النصف الأدنى $(2,4,6)$ وسيطه $Q_1=4$، والنصف الأعلى $(10,12,14)$ وسيطه $Q_3=12$.

3. نطرح: $IQR=12-4=8$.

$Q_1=4,\quad Q_3=12,\quad IQR=12-4=8$

$8$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4+8=12$

لا تخلط المدى الكلي بالمدى الربيعي.$mw$,$mw$The interquartile range is the third quartile minus the first.

$IQR=Q_3-Q_1$

1. The overall median is 8; exclude it as the question specifies.

2. The lower half $(2,4,6)$ has median $Q_1=4$; the upper half $(10,12,14)$ has median $Q_3=12$.

3. Subtract: $IQR=12-4=8$.

$Q_1=4,\quad Q_3=12,\quad IQR=12-4=8$

$8$ Dimensionless

$4+8=12$

Do not confuse the full range with the IQR.$mw$);
DO $audit$
DECLARE b record; d "CurriculumDraftItems"%ROWTYPE; p "Problems"%ROWTYPE; tr int; sk int; n int; actor int;
BEGIN
 FOR b IN SELECT * FROM reviewed_batch ORDER BY source LOOP
  PERFORM pg_advisory_xact_lock(-b.source::bigint);
  SELECT * INTO STRICT d FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "Id"=b.draft FOR UPDATE;
  SELECT * INTO STRICT p FROM "Problems" WHERE "Id"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "QuestionOptions" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source FOR UPDATE;
  actor:=d."OwnerUserId"; tr:=(b.wizard->'TrackIds'->>0)::int; sk:=(b.wizard->>'PrimarySkillId')::int;
  IF d."SourceProblemId" IS DISTINCT FROM b.source OR d."Revision"<>0 OR d."EditorialStatus"<>'Draft' OR d."PublishedProblemId" IS NOT NULL OR d."SourceFingerprint" IS DISTINCT FROM b.fp OR md5(d."WizardJson") IS DISTINCT FROM b.draft_hash OR upper(encode(sha256(decode(b.source_hex,'hex')),'hex'))<>b.fp OR (SELECT json_build_object('Id',pp."Id",'StageId',pp."StageId",'CategoryId',pp."CategoryId",'Points',pp."Points",'TitleAr',pp."TitleAr",'TitleEn',pp."TitleEn",'QuestionTextAr',pp."QuestionTextAr",'QuestionTextEn',pp."QuestionTextEn",'DetailedSolutionAr',pp."DetailedSolutionAr",'DetailedSolutionEn',pp."DetailedSolutionEn",'YoutubeSolutionUrl',pp."YoutubeSolutionUrl",'EditorialDetailsJson',pp."EditorialDetailsJson",'Options',(select json_agg(json_build_object('Id',o."Id",'Order',o."Order",'LatexCode',o."LatexCode",'IsCorrect',o."IsCorrect") order by o."Order",o."Id") from "QuestionOptions" o where o."ProblemId"=pp."Id"))::jsonb FROM "Problems" pp WHERE pp."Id"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM b.snapshot THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Source/draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Users" WHERE "Id"=actor AND "Role"='Admin' AND "IsActive" AND NOT "StaffSetupPending") OR (SELECT count(*) FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" WHERE "SourceProblemId"=b.source AND "EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn'))<>1 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Owner/open-draft conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  PERFORM 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int) ORDER BY "Id" FOR UPDATE;
  IF NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTracks" WHERE "Id"=tr AND "StageId"=p."StageId" AND "IsPublished" AND "Revision"<2147483647) OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Categories" WHERE "Id"=p."CategoryId" AND "StageId"=p."StageId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumSkills" s JOIN "CurriculumDomains" dm ON dm."Id"=s."DomainId" WHERE s."Id"=sk AND s."StageId"=p."StageId" AND s."CategoryId"=p."CategoryId" AND s."IsPublished" AND dm."IsPublished") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=tr AND "SkillId"=sk) OR (SELECT array_agg("TrackId" ORDER BY "TrackId") FROM "LearningTrackProblems" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY(SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int ORDER BY 1) OR (SELECT array_agg("SkillId" ORDER BY "SkillId") FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source) IS DISTINCT FROM ARRAY[sk] OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumProblemSkills" WHERE "ProblemId"=b.source AND "SkillId"=sk AND "IsPrimary") OR EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds') j(id) LEFT JOIN "LearningTracks" lt ON lt."Id"=j.id::int WHERE lt."Id" IS NULL OR lt."StageId"<>p."StageId" OR lt."Revision">=2147483647 OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackCategories" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "CategoryId"=p."CategoryId") OR NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "LearningTrackSkills" WHERE "TrackId"=lt."Id" AND "SkillId"=sk)) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Scope conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "Problems" q WHERE q."Id"<>b.source AND q."StageId"=p."StageId" AND (upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextAr"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')) OR upper(regexp_replace(btrim(q."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g'))=upper(regexp_replace(btrim(p."QuestionTextEn"),'[[:space:]]+',' ','g')))) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM "CurriculumDraftItems" x WHERE x."Id"<>b.draft AND x."EditorialStatus" NOT IN ('Published','Withdrawn') AND (x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,Ar}'=p."QuestionTextAr" OR x."WizardJson"::jsonb#>>'{Question,En}'=p."QuestionTextEn")) THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Open draft duplicate: %',b.draft; END IF;
  IF b.wizard#>>'{Question,Ar}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextAr" OR b.wizard#>>'{Question,En}' IS DISTINCT FROM p."QuestionTextEn" OR length(b.flat_ar)>12000 OR length(b.flat_en)>12000 THEN RAISE EXCEPTION 'Question/length conflict: %',b.draft; END IF;
  UPDATE "Problems" SET "TitleAr"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,Ar}',"TitleEn"=b.wizard#>>'{Title,En}',"DetailedSolutionAr"=b.flat_ar,"DetailedSolutionEn"=b.flat_en,"EditorialDetailsJson"=b.metadata WHERE "Id"=b.source;
  UPDATE "CurriculumDraftItems" SET "WizardJson"=b.wizard::text,"EditorialStatus"='Published',"Revision"=4,"SubmittedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedAtUtc"=now(),"ReviewedByUserId"=actor,"ReviewNote"='Owner-authorized SQL maintenance; AI educational review and source-locked verification. Existing draft owner recorded for attribution; no API login.',"PublishedAtUtc"=now(),"PublishedProblemId"=b.source WHERE "Id"=b.draft;
  UPDATE "LearningTracks" SET "Revision"="Revision"+1 WHERE "Id" IN (SELECT jsonb_array_elements_text(b.wizard->'TrackIds')::int);
  INSERT INTO "PlatformActivityEvents"("ActorUserId","ActorRole","Action","Resource","ResourceId","Origin","CreatedAtUtc") SELECT actor,'Admin',action,'EditorialProblem',b.draft::text,'owner_sql',now() FROM unnest(ARRAY['EditorialDraftEdited','EditorialDraftSubmitted','EditorialDraftApproved','EditorialAmendmentPublished']) action;
 END LOOP;
END $audit$;
COMMIT;
